      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. so if the interval includes zero, does that essentially negate the p-value? it feels like there's this weird contradiction where one tells me it's significant and the other makes it look like it might not be. how do I explain this tension in my discussion section without sounding like I don't know what I'm doing?",
